{"id":"654865","name":"卤牛肉","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/654865/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"生姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"八角","amount":"适量"},{"name":"桂皮","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香叶","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"生姜洗净切片备用。","img":"images/654865/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"适量香料备用。","img":"images/654865/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"牛腱子洗净备用。","img":"images/654865/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"牛肉清水洗净（另外买的牛排骨也一起卤了）。","img":"images/654865/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中热油放入香料下锅。","img":"images/654865/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把香料炒出香味。","img":"images/654865/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"炒好的香料盛入砂锅中。","img":"images/654865/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入牛肉。","img":"images/654865/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入生抽，老抽和适量盐。","img":"images/654865/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/654865/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"盖上大火煮开后转小火卤2小时左右。","img":"images/654865/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"卤好的牛肉筷子可以轻易穿插过去。","img":"images/654865/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"将牛肉捞出晾凉切片即可。","img":"images/654865/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"晾凉后切片即可。","img":"images/654865/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/654865/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/654865/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}